Caelestia for Pop!_OS

Modified Caelestia Shell source is included under shell/ from
https://github.com/caelestia-dots/shell
base revision 454f46da16ae75cc57f34adf48dea74db0fa5175.
Its original GPL-3.0 license and source notices are preserved.

Caelestia CLI overrides derive from caelestia-dots/cli at the revision recorded
in pins.json and retain GPL-3.0 terms. New installer, integration and native
window-action code in this project is distributed under GPL-3.0-or-later.

The installation design was informed by 12errh/caelestia-ubuntu; its MIT notice
is preserved under licenses/caelestia-ubuntu-MIT.txt. This is an independent
community adaptation, not an official System76 or Caelestia distribution.

Separately downloaded dependencies retain their upstream licenses. See
licenses/upstream-runtime-notices.md. Source pins and build scripts are
provided; third-party binaries and user account credentials are not included.

The original geometric wallpaper in assets/ is CC0-1.0 as described there.
